Opt-in reference data, not a trust store

The certificates directory contains 179 CA certificate files: 175 RSA
and four Ed448 certificates. The reference-ed521 directory contains the
unchanged ICP-Brasilv7.crt certificate with Ed521 algorithm identifier
1.3.6.1.4.1.44588.2.1. OpenSSL cannot verify this private algorithm;
the file is kept solely as historical algorithm/reference data.

No combined CA bundle, trust registration, search path, profile hook or
activation program is supplied. Intermediate CA certificates must not be
promoted to trust anchors merely because this collection includes them.

This dated snapshot does not establish current certificate validity,
cryptographic chain verification, revocation status, permitted purposes or
legal acceptance. Obtain current issuer certificates and revocation data
and select an appropriate application policy independently. This package
does not include end-user keys, a signing application or a CRL/OCSP service.
